this</span> <span begin="01:20.749" end="01:20.906">al</span><span begin="01:20.906" end="01:21.109">bum</span> <span begin="01:21.109" end="01:21.403">ac</span><span begin="01:21.403" end="01:21.584">tual</span><span begin="01:21.584" end="01:21.712">ly</span> <span begin="01:21.712" end="01:21.801">come</span> <span begin="01:21.801" end="01:21.864">in</span><span begin="01:21.864" end="01:22.044">to</span> <span begin="01:22.044" end="01:22.144">e</span><span begin="01:22.144" end="01:22.278">xis</span><span begin="01:22.278" end="01:22.681">tence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也是她真正意义上拯救了我的灵魂 并给予我帮助 使得这张专辑得以问世</span></p></div></body></tt>